  <p id="c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun:opening" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun:opening:m0000" ref="u3f_18y_2gb">王脩</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun:opening:m0003" ref="u3f_18y_2gb">叔治</persName>，北海營陵人也。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun:grief" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">至高密，聞<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun:grief:m0005" ref="288_149_559">譚</persName>死，下馬號哭曰：「無君焉歸？」遂詣<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun:grief:m0023" ref="dad_b77_b38">太祖</persName>，乞收葬<persName id="c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun:grief:m0029" ref="288_149_559">譚</persName>屍。</p>
</text>
